    "chunk_text": "\ufffdu wilt \u00e6t anum menn habban \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee lica\u00f0, \u00feu scealt him oft ge\u00f0afian \u00f0\u00e6t \u00fee ne lica\u00f0. Ne meaht \u00f0u \u00e6t nanum menn habban his good, buton \u00feu m\u00e6ge hwilum his yfel ge\u00f0afian: for\u00f0am \u00fee Styr \u00feeah \u00e6lces yfles swa \u00feu swi\u00f0ost m\u00e6ge, swa \u00f0eah \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu hit to wyrsan ne gebringe: ne bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Gemet ne sec\u00f0 nan selre. Gif \u00e6nig mon bi\u00f0 a \u00f0e unwior\u00f0ra \u00fee hine monig wis mon forsih\u00f0, \u00f0onne bi\u00f0 \u00e6lc dysig mon \u00fee On \u00e6lcere ea swa wyrse fordes, swa betere fisces. Hwe\u00f0er sceal cepinge \u00fee lofigen: \u00fee se \u00fee heo syllen sceall, \u00fee se \u00fee heo byggen wyle. Wa \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feeode \u00fee h\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00e6l\u00f0eodigne cyng ungemetf\u00e6stne, feoh georne, & unmildheortne for on \u00fe\u00e6re Se \u00f0e anwaldes wilna\u00f0 ofer his hlaford, for twam \u00feingum he his wilna\u00f0: o\u00f0er twegra, o\u00fe\u00fee he wile Ne acse \u00feu nanre wicce r\u00e6des, ne sech \u00feu riht \u00e6t deaden: so\u00f0lice god ascune\u00f0 swylce \u00feing. Ne nym \u00feu medsceattes, for heo abl\u00e6nde\u00f0 wisra manna ge\u00f0ancas & w\u00e6nde\u00f0 rihtwisra word. Ac sanctus Agustinus s\u00e6de swi\u00f0e swutul bispell by \u00f0y: gif ma manna wilnode on anre \u00f0eode anwaldes \u00deonne nella\u00f0 \u00fea heafdu eall anes weges. Ac gif \u00f0e heafdu anes weges nella\u00f0, \u00feonne sceal \u00fe",
